Create a password-login user and add them to a team

Usage:
  mcp-runtime team user create [team-slug] [flags]

Flags:
      --email string      Platform account email
  -h, --help              help for create
      --password-stdin    Read the platform account password from stdin instead of prompting
      --role string       Team role for the user: member or owner (default "member")
      --username string   Alias for --email

Global Flags:
      --debug   Enable debug mode with structured error logging
